	"data": "Path-Conditioned Retrieval — Play-Bleed Prototype\n\nThe same query returns different results depending on where you've been.\nThis is the text-layer implementation of ThoughtBubbles' play-bleed mechanic.\n\nWhat Was Built\n\nA new module scripts/vault_rag/traversal.py that wraps the existing VaultSearchEngine with traversal-aware scoring. It's the first concrete implementation of the \"Axis 4: Traversal-Aware\" concept from the Sep 30 deep heartbeat findings.\n\nArchitecture\n\nThree…",
